# Copy to .env and adjust as needed.

# Backend API base URL. Local dev usually points at your machine's LAN IP
# (see apps/seller-mobile/.env) so a phone on the same Wi-Fi can reach it.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.7:5001/api

# Google Maps integration point (src/config/maps.ts) -- the store-location
# picker on Business Details / Profile renders a plain address form (no map)
# until this is set. Restrict the key to Maps JavaScript API + Places API,
# and by package name + SHA-1 (native) / HTTP referrer (web) -- it ships in
# the client bundle either way. Same value as apps/mobile's
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY works fine if that key isn't
# package-restricted to com.mechbazar.mobile specifically.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
